Z||000014||87ECO5||10-26-2001||01:10 PM||||I just put a new distributor cap and rotor on a few months ago.<P>Got a response from Ed:<P><I><BR>Scott, best guess is the cold start injector switch or fuel pump not priming for 2 sec's before cranking.<P>Let me know what you find out.<BR></I><P>I'm pretty sure the pump is running.  I can hear a faint humming noise when the key is turned to the 'ON' position.<P>Can someone give me details on this cold start injector switch?||||reg||1
